{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>At my feet.</b> With my foot — on account of my coming the blessing came to you, as in ״הָעָם אֲשֶׁר בְּרַגְלֶיךָ״ (Exodus 11), ״לָעָם אֲשֶׁר בְּרַגְלַי״ (Judges 8) — those who come with me." "<b>And I too, for my house.</b> For the needs of my house. Now, what is done for my needs is only my children, and I too need to act along with them to support them — and that is the force of גַּם."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:19.310081750Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}